Wing Commander CD32 2.0b (13.06.2026)
Original slave: Psygore. CD32 improvements: Vesa Halttunen.

Development candidate; release and visual acceptance remain open.
Fast RAM is required. OCS is a separate, unchanged project target.

CUSTOM1 selects language: 0 English (default), 1 German.
CUSTOM5 selects the mode:
  0 Enhanced (default, also used when the option is unset)
  1 Psygore normal
  2 Psygore unlimited
  3 Psygore relaxed
  4 Psygore slow

The numbering has changed: Psygore's old CUSTOM5 values 0..3 are now 1..4.
His old value 4 (blitter conversion) is removed. Update existing tooltypes;
an old CUSTOM5=1 now means Psygore normal, not unlimited.
CUSTOM1 is language only; the experimental CUSTOM1=2/3 switches do not
apply to this candidate. Separate experimental builds retain their old options.

Enhanced English flight runs its world at 10 updates/s and renders without
Psygore's frame cap. The display-end wait remains for now; the actual frame
rate depends on the machine and scene. Enhanced nonflight scenes, including
the intro, keep Psygore's normal limiter until their movement is decoupled.
German with CUSTOM5=0 falls back to Psygore normal until it is ported.
CUSTOM5=1..4 retain Psygore's original simulation and rendering in both languages.

Enhanced English preserves WHDLoad's cache choices. Use WHDLoad CACHE/DCACHE
options to enable caches as appropriate; the enhanced mode does not enable
them itself. Psygore modes retain his original cache request.
CUSTOM2 (cheats), CUSTOM3 (system), CUSTOM4 (mission) are unchanged.

Known gaps: horizontal-row glitches reported by the user are unresolved.
Smoothness, player translation and hard-turn corrections need further work.
Real 040 performance is uncalibrated. Controls, campaign/save coverage and
final release play-testing remain open. No release archive is approved yet.
